to follow through on the user's requests and manage the data effectively. I'll make sure to keep everything organized and ready for the user!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"I checked for any stored memory reference to your earlier records, but I didn’t find one in session memory. I’m going to pull the patient record, timeline, and genomics profile directly so I can combine that with what you’re feeling now.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0b6dba701581cd2e0169b986691a0881919c7ba0b8e4520e49\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ZFldvUkXlT3YENIxuWEE2fIo|fc_0b6dba701581cd2e0169b9866cb3988191b167ff3721986f78","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 ~/.openclaw/skills/patient-klm/scripts/patient_klm_api.py get-patient --patient-id P-001","workdir":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-doctor-agent","yieldMs":10000},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"python3 ~/.openclaw/skills/patient-klm/scripts/patient_klm_api.py get-patient --patient-id P-001\",\"workdir\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-doctor-agent\",\"yieldMs\":10000}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_w3ax11y246RO4C0qZBG5Ujr4|fc_0b6dba701581cd2e0169b9866cb3a48191b288eb2efa988896","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 ~/.openclaw/skills/patient-klm/scripts/patient_klm_api.py get-timeline --patient-id P-001","workdir":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-doctor-agent","yieldMs":10000},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"python3 ~/.openclaw/skills/patient-klm/scripts/patient_klm_api.py get-timeline --patient-id P-001\",\"workdir\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-doctor-agent\",\"yieldMs\":10000}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_fN6QwkQp0Nf4DsPERPRVE5cu|fc_0b6dba701581cd2e0169b9866cb3ac8191a804a01eeab844a5","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 ~/.openclaw/skills/patient-klm/scripts/patient_klm_api.py get-genomics --patient-id P-001","workdir":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-doctor-agent","yieldMs":10000},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"python3 ~/.openclaw/skills/patient-klm/scripts/patient_klm_