{"type":"message","id":"781e6e65","parentId":"c168e610","timestamp":"2026-03-17T16:52:43.171Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] Understood — so the exhaustion is **not explained by current sunitinib use**, which keeps other causes higher on the list, including **kidney/urologic disease, cancer-related causes, anemia, infection, or CKD-related issues**.\n\nPlease answer the **last remaining question**:\n\n5. Any **new leg weakness, numbness, tingling, or loss of bowel/bladder control**?","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0b6dba701581cd2e0169b986d93d608191b6acf713802cf5ff\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":383,"output":92,"cacheRead":36224,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":36699,"cost":{"input":0.0009575000000000001,"output":0.00138,"cacheRead":0.009056,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0113935}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773766355344}}
