{"type":"message","id":"4b479fbe","parentId":"f6fc5dc7","timestamp":"2026-03-17T16:55:27.873Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0b6dba701581cd2e0169b9876ebcc88191bca37e0e4d8d1b86\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpuYdvViqSheqivDC0v7Jd2RsUsmxi_Sooe-_MGTBWntfUiwddoOQaMwll9HvSacT_EDWj-Qqpc4-50FU25ewPm25FdlT5z9-frdNDFY3uGdqW32LbFCFO811PuMaq9kBTzYzBFt82cD8kz202OKFRHMG-_GRFF8LB7hi30JaBEUyyeWIqCfCiRELJULShfcQUlIARkwASj4g22wsKb4Tp9Jzt-PAXZqGH-XYuPIJJYACLQlIm2txvngV9AxUYf5o_GLPSbZNwopD2SlLE_4zLVnFKbsWVs1N2LBx81XumRMU2QoIy5GUyxcyJ38Dg8Thn8xC8un4lMuSjswfltmcvXHiAFjHeujK0mrGc5H2TFCivpaoflEQPLymaw7awYFRRsHHVmcoIk9P5tBEfaBJlrDa3YmjzJNv2sVFKLTxJ4birJvz-6wxFBjbe-YLrgCgP0stgGhS905Ove93c6JCioIbBzOPaec3fAKAGf2xhpTkgiZRrIMNs3Y0sV3n8wVHJBGYYb5WM28FusPvZSjUaYPzhFefPhWQFI9rXv5Ham_dur4zvb30s_Z43QY37BZCAmIryzKDFtyoByBK0MRuwshfRHgjxmuhMvPALHKHDQbDWBdaLyOxxL5qNwCHKl84wA4aZe2lqA-yVHeZIAPx8VyFKaS_3MDmdS-ifoAh8QTvgnJ0Y3_jLLB7aYZZREu2CMd9pfpwFOGHJQXKox0mHzYKRvNT9pDk84t3bsOBnq2edPwpqZjoWiHlrLnq4y5ualk0RVbUsad5lbMlvQNvLmJwm3yE2munckPcqVc27cQf0BSxXJSui71lU5A4xW_GXs9sHknRoox4ZaglcWgzW1-0W19dQTu6SiGsWD86WqcAvwyRkGUO9J6o_H6SfVh2rEKXM9PVCJkkfANs8xKnItesB9A==\",\"summary\":[]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] I couldn’t complete the LLM Distillation tool run because its Hugging Face access token appears to be expired.\n\nI can still give you a careful manual distillation right now:\n\n### Distilled summary\nYour current picture is concerning because several things are lining up at once: **worsening right-sided low back/flank-region pain**, **marked fatigue**, **blood in the urine**, **burning with urination**, **unintentional weight loss**, and **leg numbness**. On top of that, your record already shows a history of **right clear cell renal cell carcinoma**, **post-nephrectomy follow-up**, and **chronic kidney disease with reduced kidney function**. Your recent records also mention **fatigue and hematuria**, so this is not an isolated new symptom.\n\nThe kidney imaging pipeline you asked me to run produced a **kidney_tumor** classification with **very high confidence (~99.998%)**, and the image analyzer also labeled it **kidney_tumor**. That does **not** prove a diagnosis by itself, but it is a meaningful concerning signal when combined with your history and current symptoms. In other words, the tool output is **consistent with a possible kidney tumor-related abnormality**, but it still needs confirmation through proper clinical review and formal imaging interpretation.\n\nThere are a few possible explanations, but the most important ones are:\n- a **kidney/urologic problem requiring prompt reassessment**, including recurrence/progression, bleeding, obstruction, infection, or stone disease\n- a **spine/nerve-related problem**, because low back pain plus **leg numbness** can reflect nerve irritation or compression\n- **CKD/anemia/systemic illness** contributing to the exhaustion\n\n### What feels most important\nThis is **not reassuring enough to monitor casually at home**. The combination of:\n- **hematuria**\n- **weight loss**\n- **fatigue**\n- **prior kidney cancer**\n- **leg numbness**\n\nmeans you should get **prompt in-person medical assessment**, ideally through your **oncology/urology team today or as soon as possible**.\n\n### Go urgently / emergency now if any of these are happening\n- worsening leg numbness or **new weakness**\n- trouble walking\n- **loss of bladder or bowel control**\n- severe or rapidly worsening pain\n- fever/chills\n- vomiting\n- reduced urine output\n- heavy visible bleeding in urine\n\nIf you want, I can next help you with one of these:\n1. a **short urgent message** you can send to your oncologist/urologist  \n2. a **clinic/ER handoff summary** based on your history and today’s findings  \n3. a **structured list of the most relevant findings** from your EHR + image analysis for the doctor","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0b6dba701581cd2e0169b9876f4c248191ba0ce402403ceb88\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":170,"output":596,"cacheRead":50816,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":51582,"cost":{"input":0.00042500000000000003,"output":0.00894,"cacheRead":0.012704,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.022069}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773766509022}}
